                <mxCell id="note1" value="Use Cases Supported:&#xa;&#xa;Access-Role Management:&#xa;- Create Access (Role) functionality&#xa;- View Access (Role) functionality&#xa;- Update Access (Role) functionality&#xa;- Delete Access (Role) functionality&#xa;- Get Role Statistics&#xa;&#xa;Permission Management:&#xa;- Create Permission functionality&#xa;- View Permission functionality&#xa;- Update Permission functionality&#xa;- Delete Permission functionality&#xa;- Get Permission Statistics&#xa;&#xa;Assignment:&#xa;- Assign Permissions to Roles&#xa;- View Role-Permission Mappings" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFFACD;strokeColor=#F9A825;align=left;fontSize=10;size=15;" parent="1" vertex="1">
