                <mxCell id="note3" value="Permissions Entity&#xa;&#xa;Represents specific permissions&#xa;that can be assigned to roles&#xa;&#xa;Examples:&#xa;- CREATE_ELECTION&#xa;- VIEW_RESULTS&#xa;- MANAGE_VOTERS&#xa;- DELETE_BALLOT&#xa;- EXPORT_REPORTS" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#388E3C;align=left;fontSize=10;size=15;" parent="1" vertex="1">
